{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33808","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 罩 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 罩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芒鞋下葑中，步步沈轻罩。\n既爲菱浪颭，亦爲莲泥胶。\n人立独无声，鱼烦似相抄。\n满手搦霜鳞，思归举轻櫂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}